  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> Super Luxury (Iconic; Fabrication: N/A)<br>\n<strong>Covers:</strong> Head<br>\n<strong>SP:</strong> 13<br>\n<strong>Armor Penalty:</strong> none</p>\n<p>Iconic. Ablation it suffers is reduced by 1 (minimum 0). Built in: Smart Glasses upgraded to +1 option slot, holding Anti-Dazzle, Image Enhance, and Targeting Scope. With Melee Weapon 7+ and Evasion 7+, or Combat Awareness Rank 6+, +1 to Melee Weapon (+2 on Aimed Shots) and Evasion checks. The +1s are automated while equipped; add the extra point on Aimed Shots by hand, and disable the effect if you don't qualify. Attacks against the wearer with Smart or Improved Smart ammo take -2. After 10 minutes without losing SP it fully repairs to SP 13. Priced at the Super Luxury minimum; Corgo lists no exact cost.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Iconics &gt; Iconic Armor).</em></p>"
